WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.134
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.234 --> 00:01.304
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.304 --> 00:02.304
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.304 --> 00:03.474
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:12.584 --> 00:14.584
(Episode 22)

6
00:19.724 --> 00:21.194
I was a little taken aback at first,

7
00:21.894 --> 00:23.064
but I think you are right.

8
00:23.994 --> 00:25.534
None of us make it out of this life alive anyway.

9
00:25.964 --> 00:27.464
I am going to do everything I have not been able to do,

10
00:28.004 --> 00:31.064
stop caring about what others think, and live freely.

11
00:32.874 --> 00:33.874
Just like you.

12
00:34.544 --> 00:35.844
What is this? Is he putting on a show?

13
00:35.974 --> 00:39.274
- Should we take a listen? - Mic test.

14
00:45.784 --> 00:47.584
I haven't told anyone this about my past.

15
00:47.584 --> 00:50.724
Actually, I wanted to be a rocker.

16
00:52.694 --> 00:54.724
It was dark

17
00:56.624 --> 00:58.834
But my past

18
01:00.534 --> 01:03.234
It was hard

19
01:04.034 --> 01:05.804
But

20
01:06.374 --> 01:08.304
If I could love

21
01:08.504 --> 01:11.814
My past

22
01:12.274 --> 01:14.914
If I could paint

23
01:15.084 --> 01:18.314
A picture of

24
01:18.714 --> 01:22.284
My memories

25
01:22.824 --> 01:26.024
- March, forward! - Be quiet.

26
01:26.094 --> 01:29.694
- Be quiet. - March! Forward!

27
01:29.994 --> 01:31.864
- Be quiet. - March!

28
01:31.934 --> 01:34.164
- Turn off the music. - I am doing it.

29
01:34.234 --> 01:36.004
- Be quiet. - Come down from there.

30
01:36.064 --> 01:37.064
I did not know it would be like this.

31
01:37.134 --> 01:39.734
I am going to sing

32
01:40.374 --> 01:44.104
- Every day with you - Stop it already! Gosh!

33
01:44.174 --> 01:47.274
- Until the morning comes - What is this?

34
01:48.844 --> 01:52.114
Everyone! March!

35
01:53.954 --> 01:54.954
March

36
01:55.024 --> 01:56.054
Sir, you have been reported...

37
01:56.124 --> 01:57.184
under Article 3, Paragraph 1, Item 21...

38
01:57.354 --> 01:59.494
of the Noise Control Act for a neighbourhood disturbance.

39
02:00.394 --> 02:01.394
Excuse me?

40
02:01.994 --> 02:04.194
- A misdemeanour? - Yes.

41
02:04.264 --> 02:06.334
What misdemeanour? I was just singing.

42
02:06.864 --> 02:09.564
- I was just busking. - Well,

43
02:09.904 --> 02:11.674
the person who reported you said it was not singing...

44
02:11.734 --> 02:13.474
but a painful noise to listen to.

45
02:13.874 --> 02:15.074
- What? - That is what they said.

46
02:15.144 --> 02:16.744
We even received multiple complaints.

47
02:16.874 --> 02:18.914
What do you mean, noise?

48
02:20.144 --> 02:23.144
Did you officers not come here after hearing my singing?

49
02:24.044 --> 02:27.384
I am going to sing

50
02:27.584 --> 02:29.154
- Every day with you - Enough.

51
02:29.924 --> 02:30.954
I am sorry.

52
02:31.524 --> 02:32.924
The morning

53
02:38.734 --> 02:39.934
If I am bad at singing,

54
02:40.494 --> 02:41.534
am I not allowed to sing?

55
02:41.604 --> 02:43.464
And there were a lot of fans left earlier, too.

56
02:44.874 --> 02:46.804
Do you have to be good at using chopsticks to eat?

57
02:48.044 --> 02:51.714
Chopsticks, I'm good with chopsticks

58
02:53.744 --> 02:55.814
Actually, my condition was not very good today, my throat.

59
02:56.714 --> 02:57.784
The weather was bad.

60
03:01.524 --> 03:03.124
Darn it.

61
03:05.124 --> 03:07.424
Should I swim across the Korea Strait and come back?

62
03:08.094 --> 03:10.264
You will really get arrested by the police if you do that.

63
03:16.834 --> 03:18.304
The temperature has dropped a lot.

64
03:24.244 --> 03:25.244
But...

65
03:26.114 --> 03:27.174
since I figured...

66
03:27.374 --> 03:29.314
I wouldn't make it out of this life alive anyway,

67
03:29.644 --> 03:31.114
there are so many things I want to do now.

68
03:31.584 --> 03:32.754
Should I get a piercing?

69
03:33.414 --> 03:34.654
Pierce my nose,

70
03:35.124 --> 03:37.824
my lip, and my eyebrow.

71
03:38.224 --> 03:39.824
I saw some people with piercings the other day,

72
03:39.894 --> 03:41.694
and they looked really brave and cool.

73
03:43.024 --> 03:44.024
Should I get a tattoo?

74
03:44.094 --> 03:46.134
One that goes all the way from my ear down to my neck.

75
03:49.834 --> 03:51.304
Are you mocking me right now?

76
03:53.834 --> 03:55.344
You are mocking me on purpose, right?

77
03:56.604 --> 03:58.314
"If you run, I fly."

78
03:59.314 --> 04:01.074
"I am one step ahead of you, Han Gyu Rim."

79
04:02.414 --> 04:03.814
Are you taking revenge on me?

80
04:04.644 --> 04:05.914
What revenge?

81
04:07.584 --> 04:08.784
Are you not embarrassed by me?

82
04:09.384 --> 04:10.484
Are you not ashamed?

83
04:11.354 --> 04:12.794
I embarrassed you so much...

84
04:12.854 --> 04:15.794
and did all sorts of childish, crazy things to you.

85
04:15.924 --> 04:16.964
You should be sick and tired of me...

86
04:17.024 --> 04:18.294
and running away by now, should you not?

87
04:24.634 --> 04:25.974
You think I have not tried running away?

88
04:26.774 --> 04:28.844
Eight years ago, I was so angry after you dumped me...

89
04:29.674 --> 04:31.414
that I went to the US to forget you,

90
04:32.114 --> 04:33.144
went to Italy,

91
04:34.214 --> 04:36.514
went to the ends of the earth and did all sorts of crazy things,

92
04:38.154 --> 04:39.314
but I am not doing that anymore.

93
04:40.654 --> 04:42.524
No matter what you decide to do,

94
04:43.884 --> 04:47.054
I will not misunderstand, and I will not run away.

95
04:50.594 --> 04:51.894
With my brain...

96
04:54.494 --> 04:56.404
I guess I cannot beat you, Mu Jin.

97
04:58.234 --> 04:59.704
I just cannot win.

98
05:02.544 --> 05:03.574
Gyu Rim.

99
05:08.414 --> 05:10.684
I am feeling really down right now,

100
05:11.784 --> 05:13.154
so I will call you later.

101
05:13.584 --> 05:14.584
Gyu Rim.

102
05:34.234 --> 05:35.244
Thank you.

103
05:41.214 --> 05:43.214
My friend, here is...

104
05:43.944 --> 05:45.084
sotteok-sotteok.

105
05:46.484 --> 05:47.484
Here.

106
05:47.784 --> 05:50.424
So this is what sotteok-sotteok looks like.

107
05:50.524 --> 05:52.194
Hey, is this really your first time seeing this too?

108
05:52.754 --> 05:53.754
Yes.

109
05:59.694 --> 06:01.964
It is delicious, really delicious.

110
06:05.674 --> 06:07.604
This Han River ramyeon is delicious too.

111
06:08.674 --> 06:12.044
I had no idea the Han River had changed so beautifully.

112
06:13.514 --> 06:15.484
You were so busy running your sushi restaurant...

113
06:15.714 --> 06:17.184
that you had no time to come out to the Han River.

114
06:17.914 --> 06:20.614
I will take you out to play a lot from now on.

115
06:20.614 --> 06:23.584
Wow, if I had not met you,

116
06:23.654 --> 06:25.954
I would have lived without knowing half the world.

117
06:27.194 --> 06:29.194
You're not lying about running a sushi restaurant, are you?

118
06:30.564 --> 06:31.894
It is not a lie.

119
06:32.734 --> 06:34.064
No, rather than a sushi restaurant,

120
06:34.394 --> 06:36.034
do you live in the fish tank of a sushi restaurant?

121
06:36.564 --> 06:38.834
Swimming around with flounders and snappers,

122
06:39.604 --> 06:43.444
not a frog in a well, but like Ok Seon in a fish tank.

123
06:45.744 --> 06:48.114
- What are you talking about? - Excuse me.

124
06:49.344 --> 06:51.884
I really need to use the restroom,

125
06:52.054 --> 06:54.184
so could you watch my grandchild for just a moment?

126
06:54.254 --> 06:55.854
Yes, go ahead.

127
06:55.924 --> 06:57.154
- Thank you. - Yes.

128
06:57.424 --> 06:59.954
You are going to wet yourself. Take your time.

129
07:02.094 --> 07:03.994
Let us see.

130
07:04.864 --> 07:06.994
You are a strong little guy.

131
07:09.464 --> 07:12.674
Wait, are you a princess and not a little guy?

132
07:12.904 --> 07:13.904
Why are you crying so much?

133
07:14.174 --> 07:15.874
Why are you making the baby cry?

134
07:18.374 --> 07:21.044
Do not cry, little one.

135
07:21.374 --> 07:23.514
I will push the stroller for you.

136
07:24.614 --> 07:25.954
If you keep crying,

137
07:26.014 --> 07:29.384
Santa Claus will not bring you any presents.

138
07:36.324 --> 07:37.694
You are good with kids.

139
07:39.264 --> 07:41.164
You must watch your grandchildren often.

140
07:44.234 --> 07:45.374
If...

141
07:45.774 --> 07:48.444
Mu Jin had a son, what would you do?

142
07:50.104 --> 07:51.304
Today,

143
07:52.074 --> 07:54.174
I think I saw Mu Jin's son, Mom.

144
07:57.714 --> 07:58.714
No,

145
07:59.714 --> 08:00.914
I have never babysat them.

146
08:03.984 --> 08:05.124
So you do not have any grandchildren.

147
08:05.894 --> 08:08.964
Then again, you do not look like someone...

148
08:09.024 --> 08:10.364
who should be called a grandmother yet.

149
08:11.694 --> 08:13.664
I do not look like a grandfather either,

150
08:14.864 --> 08:16.864
but I have a grandson.

151
08:19.974 --> 08:22.474
I think I do have a grandson.

152
08:24.744 --> 08:26.674
But I have never seen his face.

153
08:27.314 --> 08:28.514
What does that mean?

154
08:32.254 --> 08:33.814
Your son went crazy over a woman...

155
08:34.084 --> 08:35.724
and left home saying he would never see you again,

156
08:36.184 --> 08:37.324
and he had a son.

157
08:40.424 --> 08:43.794
Hey, then is it not game over?

158
08:44.264 --> 08:47.264
You have to accept her as your daughter-in-law even if you hate it,

159
08:47.364 --> 08:48.564
since she gave you a grandson.

160
08:50.834 --> 08:51.834
No way.

161
08:52.734 --> 08:54.704
If it comes to it, I can just take my grandson.

162
09:04.614 --> 09:08.154
While you were washing up, Mr. Mu Jin called.

163
09:08.384 --> 09:09.654
On your phone.

164
09:10.584 --> 09:11.584
Okay.

165
09:30.144 --> 09:32.374
I bought that for you, right?

166
09:32.744 --> 09:35.384
- For your birthday. - That is right.

167
09:35.484 --> 09:36.744
Where did my son get the money...

168
09:36.814 --> 09:40.984
- to buy such nice cosmetics? - To buy you makeup,

169
09:41.184 --> 09:43.784
I worked hard to save my allowance and New Year's money.

170
09:44.824 --> 09:47.054
Da Som's mom uses it too.

171
09:48.364 --> 09:51.624
Really? So it was Da Som's mom's choice?

172
09:51.934 --> 09:53.694
No wonder it is so moisturizing.

173
09:55.264 --> 09:57.434
Do you not think my skin is glowing?

174
09:57.734 --> 10:00.434
It is glowing, Mom.

175
10:03.004 --> 10:05.714
When I answered his call earlier,

176
10:05.914 --> 10:08.244
I asked him not to hate you too much...

177
10:09.184 --> 10:11.854
even if you act weird around him.

178
10:13.354 --> 10:14.414
Gyeol,

179
10:15.014 --> 10:16.724
do you like him that much?

180
10:35.774 --> 10:36.944
Hey, Gyu Rim.

181
10:37.304 --> 10:38.844
Did you get home safely?

182
10:39.974 --> 10:40.974
No, not yet...

183
10:41.914 --> 10:42.914
Yes.

184
10:44.214 --> 10:47.414
I talked to Gyeol earlier, and he said you were washing up.

185
10:58.494 --> 11:00.394
I have a favour to ask, Mu Jin.

186
11:01.194 --> 11:02.864
Okay. Ask away.

187
11:04.634 --> 11:06.234
Except telling me to get lost.

188
11:10.574 --> 11:11.674
With your mother...

189
11:13.144 --> 11:14.244
Make up with her.

190
11:17.614 --> 11:20.384
A love that requires you to cut ties with your mother.

191
11:22.154 --> 11:23.554
I won't do that.

192
11:26.494 --> 11:30.124
Even though my father caused so much trouble,

193
11:30.964 --> 11:32.664
we still didn't abandon him.

194
11:33.394 --> 11:34.994
That's why we live together.

195
11:38.134 --> 11:40.604
No matter how much I love you,

196
11:41.704 --> 11:44.004
I can't be with someone who abandoned his family.

197
11:44.944 --> 11:46.044
No,

198
11:47.214 --> 11:48.374
I won't be with you.

199
11:51.044 --> 11:53.654
No matter how much you love me,

200
11:56.184 --> 11:57.954
I don't think it's worth...

201
11:59.224 --> 12:02.524
cutting ties with your family for me.

202
12:05.124 --> 12:07.934
- Gyu Rim. - Make up with your mother...

203
12:09.234 --> 12:10.504
and get her permission.

204
12:12.004 --> 12:13.574
Until you get her permission,

205
12:14.334 --> 12:20.614
I will wait 100 or 1,000 years.

206
12:37.924 --> 12:43.034
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

207
12:47.674 --> 12:51.344
- Honey. - I heard this place is famous,

208
12:51.404 --> 12:54.214
so I came early. Is it too early? Let's go in.

209
13:09.864 --> 13:11.094
Welcome.

210
13:13.694 --> 13:14.864
Thank you.

211
13:16.104 --> 13:17.664
Have you not eaten?

212
13:18.304 --> 13:20.804
Eat slowly. You'll get indigestion.

213
13:22.144 --> 13:23.944
It's because the food here is so good.

214
13:24.244 --> 13:26.414
We should have our company dinners here from now on.

215
13:31.644 --> 13:33.814
I have something to tell you.

216
13:37.454 --> 13:38.854
Can we have a cup of tea...

217
13:39.994 --> 13:42.024
during your break later?

218
13:43.964 --> 13:45.224
Yes, sure.

219
13:47.894 --> 13:49.004
Divorce?

220
13:56.974 --> 13:58.914
Hearing that from you...

221
14:00.074 --> 14:01.174
feels strange.

222
14:04.044 --> 14:05.044
Why?

223
14:08.854 --> 14:10.624
It's not because of you,

224
14:12.724 --> 14:15.094
and it's definitely not because of Seo Hyun.

225
14:17.664 --> 14:19.034
It's because of me.

226
14:20.394 --> 14:21.564
All this time...

227
14:24.364 --> 14:25.534
I've been wearing clothes...

228
14:26.134 --> 14:28.604
that didn't suit me at all.

229
14:30.674 --> 14:32.844
To others, they might have seemed...

230
14:33.274 --> 14:35.684
enviable, bright, and glamorous.

231
14:38.854 --> 14:40.114
But honestly,

232
14:40.814 --> 14:43.384
I felt anxious and uncomfortable...

233
14:44.324 --> 14:45.524
the whole time I wore them.

234
14:48.124 --> 14:49.964
Now that I've taken them all off,

235
14:50.694 --> 14:52.234
I feel so comfortable and free.

236
14:59.004 --> 15:01.004
I don't need alimony.

237
15:01.604 --> 15:03.004
All this time...

238
15:05.574 --> 15:07.374
I've received so much from you...

239
15:10.514 --> 15:13.014
that I can barely hold my head up.

240
15:15.584 --> 15:18.694
Even if I lived ten more lifetimes,

241
15:20.994 --> 15:22.964
I couldn't repay...

242
15:26.434 --> 15:28.194
even half of your kindness.

243
15:41.314 --> 15:42.544
Honey, let's do this.

244
15:44.244 --> 15:46.754
I have something I need to take care of right now.

245
15:48.954 --> 15:51.984
Yes. It's something only I can do,

246
15:52.624 --> 15:54.094
so let's finish that...

247
15:55.054 --> 15:57.794
Once I finish that, let's talk again.

248
15:58.264 --> 15:59.394
Okay?

249
16:01.364 --> 16:03.504
- Hoon Tae. - Let's do that.

250
16:04.134 --> 16:05.164
Yes.

251
16:05.774 --> 16:06.834
Right.

252
16:07.604 --> 16:08.844
About the divorce...

253
16:11.404 --> 16:13.474
Let's keep it a secret from Seo Hyun for now,

254
16:14.614 --> 16:16.244
and once I am all done with my work,

255
16:16.884 --> 16:20.654
I will tell her it is over then. Let's talk again then.

256
16:21.954 --> 16:23.624
Please wait just a little longer until then.

257
16:24.354 --> 16:25.554
You can do that, right?

258
16:36.264 --> 16:38.774
Han Gyu Young, Gyu Young, hey.

259
16:46.744 --> 16:49.414
- What time is it? - It is 3:10.

260
16:49.644 --> 16:52.484
I slept for seven hours.

261
16:53.784 --> 16:56.154
Hey, isn't today Sunday? Why did you come to the office?

262
16:56.354 --> 16:58.084
Because of a cosmetics commercial shoot.

263
16:58.684 --> 17:00.494
Anyway, what about you?

264
17:00.554 --> 17:01.754
Did you sleep at the office yesterday?

265
17:02.024 --> 17:03.794
You look exactly the same as yesterday.

266
17:10.264 --> 17:13.704
They found out about my fake father...

267
17:13.774 --> 17:15.334
and my lie that my family is rich.

268
17:16.174 --> 17:18.704
So? Hey, did you get kicked out?

269
17:26.484 --> 17:27.754
Yes, this is Han Gyu Young.

270
17:28.214 --> 17:29.584
This is Jang Hoon Tae.

271
17:34.894 --> 17:36.764
Are you surprised that I called so suddenly?

272
17:37.564 --> 17:38.564
No.

273
17:44.204 --> 17:45.234
Well...

274
17:46.134 --> 17:47.234
It seems your husband's family...

275
17:48.274 --> 17:49.774
has figured everything out.

276
17:50.474 --> 17:51.674
Did you know?

277
17:55.614 --> 17:57.314
How did you know, Chairman?

278
17:59.384 --> 18:01.784
Your father-in-law came all the way to my office.

279
18:06.924 --> 18:09.324
They knew everything from the beginning.

280
18:09.324 --> 18:10.694
That I swapped my father...

281
18:12.834 --> 18:15.394
Even knowing I lied about you being my father,

282
18:16.734 --> 18:18.034
they pretended to be fooled.

283
18:20.934 --> 18:21.934
I see.

284
18:23.974 --> 18:26.274
They had a bigger plan all along.

285
18:27.774 --> 18:28.814
What do you mean?

286
18:33.884 --> 18:36.184
Do not be too shocked by what I am about to tell you.

287
18:39.694 --> 18:41.624
I hired someone to look into them,

288
18:42.764 --> 18:44.824
and your parents-in-law...

289
18:46.534 --> 18:49.804
have 4 and 3 fraud convictions.

290
18:50.664 --> 18:53.404
Plus, they have served actual prison time...

291
18:53.534 --> 18:54.634
for blackmail and defamation.

292
18:55.474 --> 18:57.804
And your husband, Kang Sung Wook.

293
18:59.274 --> 19:01.244
He has multiple records...

294
19:01.314 --> 19:03.184
of assaulting his ex-girlfriends and women he lived with.

295
19:03.814 --> 19:05.684
Three of those cases actually led to bookings.

296
19:07.654 --> 19:08.884
Are you sure you are not mistaken?

297
19:09.524 --> 19:10.984
Did you perhaps investigate the wrong person?

298
19:14.294 --> 19:15.894
Pull yourself together and listen to me.

299
19:18.464 --> 19:19.834
That business your father-in-law supposedly runs...

300
19:20.534 --> 19:22.904
is a paper company, a shell company with nothing to it.

301
19:24.204 --> 19:25.704
You said your mother-in-law runs a gallery, right?

302
19:25.804 --> 19:27.004
That is not a gallery.

303
19:28.034 --> 19:31.004
It was an unlicensed bar in Gangnam operating illegally.

304
19:32.174 --> 19:33.274
The house they live in now?

305
19:34.874 --> 19:36.644
Of course it is not theirs,

306
19:37.384 --> 19:39.114
and they have been paying rent for a while.

307
19:40.014 --> 19:41.214
The worst part is...

308
19:44.184 --> 19:45.654
your husband Kang Sung Wook...

309
19:46.424 --> 19:48.624
is still living a double life with the woman he lived with...

310
19:50.394 --> 19:52.834
before he even met you. That is what is happening.

311
20:00.704 --> 20:01.704
This is so embarrassing.

312
20:03.374 --> 20:04.574
This is so embarrassing.

313
20:07.014 --> 20:08.314
What I want to say is,

314
20:09.744 --> 20:11.314
before it is too late,

315
20:11.944 --> 20:13.654
can you not just end this marriage now?

316
20:14.454 --> 20:16.124
If there is anything I can do to help, I will.

317
20:19.594 --> 20:21.394
How are you going to help me, Chairman?

318
20:23.794 --> 20:24.794
Just...

319
20:25.894 --> 20:27.364
Like a father stepping up for his child,

320
20:27.434 --> 20:28.434
like a normal father.

321
20:28.534 --> 20:30.304
Yes, if you want me to grab him by the collar...

322
20:30.364 --> 20:31.534
and hit him, I will hit him,

323
20:31.604 --> 20:33.204
and I can even pull all his hair out.

324
20:33.534 --> 20:34.974
You are not even my father.

325
20:35.034 --> 20:36.574
Who says that? Who says I am not your father?

326
20:38.744 --> 20:40.544
I married your mother, and as her husband,

327
20:40.614 --> 20:41.814
I am your father too.

328
20:45.014 --> 20:46.014
Gyu Young.

329
20:48.354 --> 20:49.654
We did not scam anyone.

330
20:51.084 --> 20:52.354
I am your father.

331
20:52.894 --> 20:55.764
And from now on, I plan to act more confidently as your father.

332
20:57.594 --> 20:59.264
So that my daughter, Gyu Young,

333
21:01.334 --> 21:02.504
can find her place...

334
21:03.904 --> 21:06.574
and become happier. Until then,

335
21:08.434 --> 21:09.874
along with your biological father,

336
21:10.574 --> 21:12.514
I intend to keep my place as your father.

337
21:13.844 --> 21:16.784
And that is exactly what I ought to do.

338
21:27.894 --> 21:29.594
Did you receive this as a gift from your boyfriend?

339
21:29.894 --> 21:31.894
No, from my mother-in-law.

340
21:39.234 --> 21:40.334
Are you not going to appraise it?

341
21:41.034 --> 21:43.004
There is no need to appraise it because it is a fake.

342
21:43.544 --> 21:44.544
Excuse me?

343
21:45.004 --> 21:48.544
No, do not just glance at it. Please appraise it carefully.

344
21:48.614 --> 21:50.244
I will bet my wrist that this is a fake.

345
21:50.314 --> 21:52.714
No, I will bet this entire store.

346
22:11.364 --> 22:15.304
- Are you okay? Are you hurt? - Oh no. My hand slipped.

347
22:15.974 --> 22:17.644
Do not move and stay right there.

348
22:22.344 --> 22:24.244
- Gyu Min, step out for a second. - Right.

349
22:28.114 --> 22:29.684
That cup belonged to Gyu Young.

350
22:30.484 --> 22:32.224
She said it was some limited edition designer cup...

351
22:32.324 --> 22:33.824
and would not even let us touch it.

352
22:34.694 --> 22:35.894
Designer brand or not,

353
22:36.224 --> 22:38.024
it is not like she can take it with her when she dies.

354
22:38.494 --> 22:43.134
- She is such a fool. - I feel uneasy for no reason.

355
22:43.704 --> 22:45.904
Do you think something bad happened to Gyu Young?

356
22:46.874 --> 22:49.974
She would have called if something happened.

357
22:52.844 --> 22:55.544
You are always worrying about Gyu Young too.

358
22:56.484 --> 22:58.844
Right about here in your head, Gyu Young is always on your mind.

359
22:59.414 --> 23:01.984
Wondering if she is living well after getting married.

360
23:04.024 --> 23:05.824
And right about here is Gyeol.

361
23:07.594 --> 23:09.924
And here are Han Gyu Seo and Han Gyu Min.

362
23:10.994 --> 23:12.994
And here is Han Gyu Oh.

363
23:13.694 --> 23:14.734
Right?

364
23:21.074 --> 23:22.544
What are you doing, Father?

365
23:23.744 --> 23:25.474
Did you actually go and get that?

366
23:26.244 --> 23:28.314
Dad saw you acting a bit strange lately...

367
23:28.844 --> 23:31.784
and thought you were possessed by Gyu Young's ghost.

368
23:33.454 --> 23:36.584
I am fine now. I am back to normal, Father.

369
23:38.084 --> 23:41.494
I see. It does not seem like you are possessed by a ghost.

370
23:42.724 --> 23:45.424
I'm sorry for acting out of character and startling you.

371
23:45.794 --> 23:50.534
- It won't happen again. - See, Gyu Rim says she's fine.

372
23:51.534 --> 23:53.634
You guys said she was acting weird too.

373
23:54.234 --> 23:55.234
You were worried about Gyu Rim,

374
23:55.304 --> 23:56.904
so you even had a meeting among yourselves.

375
23:59.544 --> 24:00.544
But Dad,

376
24:01.244 --> 24:03.084
why did you go to the Han River last night?

377
24:04.084 --> 24:05.884
Why did you eat Han River ramyeon?

378
24:08.614 --> 24:12.184
You had mini kimchi with the ramyeon too.

379
24:14.294 --> 24:17.894
Did you eat sotteok-sotteok too? With lots of sauce.

380
24:19.394 --> 24:20.434
What are you?

381
24:21.194 --> 24:22.194
Who are you?

382
24:23.164 --> 24:24.264
Did the ghost go in there?

383
24:25.334 --> 24:27.634
Get out of our Gyu Min right now, you wicked thing.

384
24:29.244 --> 24:30.444
What's wrong with her?

385
24:31.504 --> 24:33.074
Did you see Father at the Han River?

386
24:33.774 --> 24:35.274
No, I was working my part-time job yesterday.

387
24:35.444 --> 24:37.384
Then how do you know that?

388
24:38.244 --> 24:39.654
How could you know I ate Han River ramyeon...

389
24:39.714 --> 24:42.984
and even sotteok-sotteok unless you're a ghost?

390
24:44.084 --> 24:45.284
How do you know?

391
24:45.884 --> 24:47.754
I saw it on the receipt in Dad's pants pocket earlier...

392
24:47.824 --> 24:49.394
when I was putting them in the washing machine.

393
24:50.164 --> 24:52.864
The receipt for the Han River ramyeon and sotteok-sotteok.

394
24:54.394 --> 24:57.104
Gosh, you startled me.

395
24:58.204 --> 24:59.804
Do you have no one else to tease but your father?

396
25:00.504 --> 25:01.834
You know how easily scared I am.

397
25:05.444 --> 25:06.544
I need to take some calming pills.

398
25:11.714 --> 25:14.284
I really enjoyed the yujadanja.

399
25:14.684 --> 25:16.824
I definitely want to return the favour.

400
25:17.484 --> 25:20.124
Please stop by the store with your girlfriend sometime.

401
25:22.724 --> 25:24.264
Please knock before you come in.

402
25:24.964 --> 25:28.494
Hey, why would a father knock to enter his son's room?

403
25:28.694 --> 25:29.734
Where is Gyu Oh?

404
25:30.134 --> 25:31.364
He went to his part-time job at dawn.

405
25:31.704 --> 25:33.504
He went to a part-time job at dawn? Gyu Oh did?

406
25:34.204 --> 25:35.404
Why is he suddenly doing that?

407
25:35.474 --> 25:37.474
It's a good thing if Gyu Oh is living diligently.

408
25:39.374 --> 25:43.044
Is it against the law for you to speak nicely to your father?

409
25:43.384 --> 25:44.484
Will you get arrested?

410
25:45.044 --> 25:46.484
This punk, seriously.

411
25:51.024 --> 25:52.024
This is nice.

412
25:55.194 --> 25:56.294
Why do you have Gyu Oh's clothes?

413
25:56.764 --> 25:58.564
I don't have anything suitable to wear,

414
25:58.794 --> 26:00.964
so I'm going to borrow a few. Why?

415
26:01.564 --> 26:02.834
Why are you borrowing Gyu Oh's clothes?

416
26:03.364 --> 26:04.564
I just told you.

417
26:04.704 --> 26:06.274
I don't have anything suitable to wear right now.

418
26:06.334 --> 26:09.404
Even so, why wear Gyu Oh's clothes? Who are you trying to impress?

419
26:09.474 --> 26:11.674
I'm trying to impress the entire population of South Korea.

420
26:11.674 --> 26:13.044
Why? Are you satisfied?

421
26:14.614 --> 26:15.614
Are you seeing a woman?

422
26:15.974 --> 26:19.954
I see women, and I see men.

423
26:20.254 --> 26:21.654
Aren't you afraid of women?

424
26:21.954 --> 26:23.684
I'm most afraid of you.

425
26:23.754 --> 26:25.584
Aren't you sick of it after what you went through?

426
26:27.454 --> 26:28.624
You might think...

427
26:28.624 --> 26:30.894
all women in the world are like that,

428
26:30.894 --> 26:32.764
but only your mother is. Only your mother.

429
26:33.634 --> 26:35.734
How do you know there isn't another woman like her?

430
26:36.034 --> 26:37.664
Sure, there probably is.

431
26:38.234 --> 26:41.134
There might be, but this woman is different.

432
26:41.634 --> 26:43.844
Ok Seon is the real deal.

433
26:47.244 --> 26:48.314
I will go with this one.

434
26:51.544 --> 26:54.684
Right, right. I do not mind being called cheap...

435
26:54.754 --> 26:58.654
or being called petty, so please do not invite me to...

436
26:58.784 --> 26:59.854
your grandchild's first birthday party.

437
27:00.554 --> 27:03.194
Hey, I went to...

438
27:03.264 --> 27:06.634
all of your children's weddings, and that is enough.

439
27:06.994 --> 27:09.094
How can you be so clueless?

440
27:09.764 --> 27:13.334
And honestly, are we even that close?

441
27:13.904 --> 27:15.634
I am not that close to you.

442
27:16.704 --> 27:17.874
Look, I cannot help it if you are upset,

443
27:17.944 --> 27:19.304
and I cannot help it if you feel hurt.

444
27:19.844 --> 27:23.314
I am not going to the party, so tell the others too.

445
27:23.814 --> 27:25.414
Anyone who sends Ok Seon an invitation...

446
27:25.484 --> 27:29.424
to a first birthday party is cut off.

447
27:32.254 --> 27:34.424
You could have just sent a gold ring.

448
27:34.824 --> 27:36.624
Why did you have to call her, Mom?

449
27:36.694 --> 27:39.094
Do you know how expensive gold is these days?

450
27:39.834 --> 27:43.404
And who even throws first birthday parties anymore?

451
27:43.464 --> 27:44.464
It is so tacky.

452
27:44.664 --> 27:46.134
They should just take pictures among themselves...

453
27:46.204 --> 27:47.534
and sing a song to celebrate.

454
27:47.604 --> 27:50.174
Why do they have to bother other people?

455
27:59.584 --> 28:01.384
My children cannot even get married,

456
28:02.084 --> 28:03.954
and even when a baby is born, I cannot see their face.

457
28:05.354 --> 28:06.654
Forget about a gold ring,

458
28:07.694 --> 28:09.424
with a mother like that,

459
28:09.664 --> 28:11.124
he probably did not even have a first birthday party.

460
28:26.104 --> 28:27.644
(Personal Profile, Han Gyeol)

461
28:42.754 --> 28:45.094
Secretary An. Listen,

462
28:45.164 --> 28:47.934
that child Han Gyu Rim is raising...

463
28:48.834 --> 28:50.334
Did you say his name is Han Gyeol?

464
28:51.604 --> 28:53.004
Do you think I could...

465
28:53.534 --> 28:54.834
meet him?

466
28:57.144 --> 28:59.714
Make up with your mother and get her permission.

467
29:00.674 --> 29:02.274
Until you get her permission,

468
29:02.344 --> 29:05.844
I will wait 100 or 1,000 years.

469
29:13.224 --> 29:16.024
(Mother)

470
29:20.334 --> 29:21.864
Darn it...

471
29:27.934 --> 29:29.334
Your sigh is going to cave the floor in.

472
29:33.314 --> 29:34.344
It has been a while.

473
29:37.714 --> 29:38.714
It has been a while.

474
29:41.114 --> 29:42.114
I am fine.

475
29:43.354 --> 29:44.654
I was wondering what to do when I saw you.

476
29:44.724 --> 29:46.324
Honestly, I was a little nervous coming here,

477
29:46.824 --> 29:47.924
but I am surprisingly fine.

478
29:48.794 --> 29:50.064
Is it okay for me to be this cool about it?

479
29:50.124 --> 29:53.064
- I am almost amazed at myself. - Just come by comfortably.

480
29:53.394 --> 29:56.164
- Jung Woo is here too. - I actually came to see Jung Woo.

481
29:56.304 --> 29:58.304
Jung Woo is my sounding board, you know.

482
30:00.204 --> 30:01.674
Should I tell Jung Woo to come down?

483
30:03.304 --> 30:05.604
Are things going well with Han Gyu Rim?

484
30:10.414 --> 30:11.744
Well, you know.

485
30:13.284 --> 30:15.014
It must be really hard for you two.

486
30:16.324 --> 30:18.924
The road ahead will be rough. I feel bad for you.

487
30:19.224 --> 30:20.554
I really do.

488
30:21.194 --> 30:22.594
Cheering for you would be too much,

489
30:22.854 --> 30:24.864
but I will not curse you to fail anymore.

490
30:27.294 --> 30:29.464
- Should I make you a cup of coffee? - Yes.

491
30:29.534 --> 30:32.334
Lots of ice and add two shots. Make it strong and cold.

492
30:34.074 --> 30:36.704
- Do you want a coffee too? - Yes. Pour-over.

493
30:46.414 --> 30:50.454
Is it not hard seeing Mu Jin? Are you really okay?

494
30:54.154 --> 30:55.794
I was so mad yesterday I thought I was going to die.

495
30:55.854 --> 30:58.094
Just sit down, Jung Woo. I have so much to say.

496
30:58.664 --> 31:00.934
Did I tell you I even got scolded by a high schooler?

497
31:02.834 --> 31:03.864
You did.

498
31:05.904 --> 31:07.474
You kept me from sleeping last night...

499
31:07.534 --> 31:09.304
and talked for 2 hours and 40 minutes.

500
31:09.374 --> 31:12.004
- 2 hours and 40 minutes. - I woke up this morning...

501
31:12.074 --> 31:13.844
and almost drew a police sketch of that high schooler.

502
31:13.914 --> 31:15.544
I get madder the more I think about it.

503
31:15.714 --> 31:18.044
Who is he to scold me so ruthlessly? Unbelievable.

504
31:18.314 --> 31:19.614
I went on a blind date, Seo Hyun.

505
31:20.284 --> 31:21.284
A blind date?

506
31:21.914 --> 31:23.354
You did not mention that.

507
31:23.584 --> 31:26.024
I did not have time because you were doing all the talking.

508
31:26.124 --> 31:28.624
My father's health suddenly got worse,

509
31:28.754 --> 31:31.794
so he told me that no matter what, I have to get married this year.

510
31:33.534 --> 31:36.834
That makes no sense. I mean, without any warning,

511
31:36.904 --> 31:40.134
how can you suddenly get married? Stop joking around.

512
31:41.234 --> 31:44.444
Fortunately, the woman seemed to like me.

513
31:44.504 --> 31:47.044
She is decent enough, so I do not mind her.

514
31:48.444 --> 31:49.984
But she said...

515
31:50.084 --> 31:51.944
she can understand everything else, but female friends?

516
31:52.014 --> 31:53.814
She cannot tolerate that.

517
31:53.884 --> 31:55.684
She asked how men and women can be just friends...

518
31:56.114 --> 31:58.524
and asked me to cut ties with them.

519
31:59.424 --> 32:00.454
What are you talking about?

520
32:00.524 --> 32:02.754
Did she time-travel from the Joseon era?

521
32:06.864 --> 32:07.864
I...

522
32:09.334 --> 32:12.204
do not want the woman I am marrying to have any misunderstandings.

523
32:13.604 --> 32:14.804
So from this moment on,

524
32:15.404 --> 32:19.944
unless it is a real emergency, do not call, text, or message me.

525
32:30.454 --> 32:31.454
Let's go in.

526
32:33.354 --> 32:36.494
- Hello, Manager. - You are here? Have you been well?

527
32:36.564 --> 32:38.494
- Yes. - It is here.

528
32:38.664 --> 32:40.664
Why are we here? To buy clothes?

529
32:41.164 --> 32:44.004
No. I am going to take over this store.

530
32:44.134 --> 32:46.434
My parents entrusted it to me and told me to give it a try.

531
32:46.904 --> 32:49.704
They said if I work hard, it has good prospects.

532
32:50.274 --> 32:53.314
Hey, that is great. It suits you.

533
32:54.374 --> 32:55.374
Congratulations.

534
32:57.584 --> 32:58.814
Let's do it together, Gyu Oh.

535
32:59.984 --> 33:01.114
Do what together?

536
33:02.654 --> 33:05.024
Hey, I cannot do it. I do not have the skills.

537
33:05.454 --> 33:07.624
I told my parents everything about you.

538
33:08.424 --> 33:10.424
From how you saved me from Son Ji Yeol...

539
33:11.164 --> 33:13.494
to how you had to live because of me. Everything.

540
33:14.364 --> 33:15.834
So they told me...

541
33:15.894 --> 33:17.304
to give you half the shares of this store.

542
33:17.364 --> 33:18.364
My parents did.

543
33:19.404 --> 33:21.334
They said they really hope you do not refuse.

544
33:22.974 --> 33:25.304
They want you to start fresh...

545
33:25.874 --> 33:27.614
here at this store with me.

546
33:28.344 --> 33:30.644
Still, how can I accept this?

547
33:31.914 --> 33:33.554
I really cannot. I do not want it.

548
33:34.184 --> 33:35.684
Should I tell my parents to come here?

549
33:36.484 --> 33:39.124
Or should I tell them to come and persuade you themselves, then?

550
33:46.224 --> 33:47.364
Hey, hold on a second.

551
33:50.234 --> 33:51.304
Yes, Grandmother.

552
33:51.864 --> 33:53.174
My lovely Gyu Oh.

553
33:54.304 --> 33:57.204
Well, you see, are you busy this evening?

554
33:58.104 --> 34:00.474
Unless it is your parents' funeral, push everything back...

555
34:00.544 --> 34:01.914
and make some time for me.

556
34:02.314 --> 34:06.144
- What is this about so suddenly? - Do not even think about saying no.

557
34:06.484 --> 34:08.914
Well, you have to tell me what it is about.

558
34:08.984 --> 34:11.524
You have to say okay first.

559
34:12.384 --> 34:13.994
This is my first and last favour, so what will it be?

560
34:14.054 --> 34:17.124
Is it a no or a yes?

561
34:19.264 --> 34:20.464
Yes, I understand.

562
34:21.594 --> 34:25.164
You said yes, right? If you change your mind later,

563
34:25.264 --> 34:27.504
I will light your backside on fire, got it?

564
34:35.074 --> 34:37.014
What is it?

565
34:37.384 --> 34:39.284
What are you going to do with Gyu Oh?

566
34:39.884 --> 34:41.414
That is none of your business.

567
34:42.084 --> 34:45.684
Director Song. I am going to head home for a bit,

568
34:45.754 --> 34:47.224
so keep an eye on the restaurant.

569
34:47.754 --> 34:49.394
Yes, have a safe trip.

570
34:53.094 --> 34:56.264
What is that old woman scheming?

571
35:09.674 --> 35:10.784
Okay.

572
35:15.284 --> 35:19.024
Is the author Joel not just so handsome?

573
35:20.194 --> 35:22.594
He is. He's exactly my type.

574
35:26.964 --> 35:28.934
How is Ms. Han Gyu Young doing?

575
35:29.734 --> 35:32.234
They must be so in love since they are newlyweds, right?

576
35:33.704 --> 35:34.974
It is not love.

577
35:35.034 --> 35:37.044
It feels like 1,000 bees...

578
35:37.344 --> 35:38.674
stung her all at once.

579
35:56.094 --> 35:57.094
What is this?

580
35:57.464 --> 35:59.524
Are you trying to run away before you get sued for fraud?

581
36:00.034 --> 36:01.634
The divorce papers are on the vanity.

582
36:01.934 --> 36:04.034
I already signed them, so you just need to sign.

583
36:04.764 --> 36:06.034
Who says you can get a divorce?

584
36:08.834 --> 36:11.504
Should I list every single way you and your parents...

585
36:11.574 --> 36:13.074
scammed me?

586
36:13.574 --> 36:15.344
Your parents are ex-convicts for fraud and blackmail,

587
36:15.414 --> 36:17.684
and they are completely broke. And you.

588
36:19.714 --> 36:21.554
I do not even want to speak because it will dirty my mouth.

589
36:24.624 --> 36:28.424
Right, well. We both scammed each other,

590
36:28.624 --> 36:29.894
and birds of a feather flock together,

591
36:29.964 --> 36:32.224
so we should just live happily ever after, then.

592
36:36.164 --> 36:37.934
I have one question for you.

593
36:38.934 --> 36:41.074
If you knew I was lying...

594
36:41.134 --> 36:43.544
and you knew my family had absolutely nothing,

595
36:44.044 --> 36:45.304
why did you marry me?

596
36:45.674 --> 36:47.044
What did you think you could leech off of me?

597
36:47.114 --> 36:50.044
Why would there be nothing to leech? There is Chairman Jang Hoon Tae.

598
36:50.114 --> 36:51.214
Your mother's husband.

599
36:52.014 --> 36:54.554
What does Chairman Jang Hoon Tae have to do with me?

600
36:54.614 --> 36:55.914
We are not even close.

601
36:55.984 --> 36:57.184
When I asked him to attend our formal family meeting,

602
36:57.254 --> 36:58.384
that was the first time I met him, too.

603
37:00.024 --> 37:02.724
I do not care about that. You choose.

604
37:02.994 --> 37:04.724
Either live with me for ten more years...

605
37:05.024 --> 37:07.234
or if you want to break up,

606
37:07.334 --> 37:09.034
pay me three million dollars in alimony.

607
37:09.294 --> 37:10.304
You are crazy.

608
37:10.934 --> 37:12.904
Fine, let us reveal everything, then.

609
37:12.964 --> 37:14.774
Let us reveal all the scams we pulled...

610
37:14.834 --> 37:18.104
- and face the law, then. - Sure, reveal it all.

611
37:18.444 --> 37:20.044
You and Chairman Jang Hoon Tae have a lot to lose.

612
37:20.114 --> 37:21.414
We have nothing left to lose.

613
37:21.774 --> 37:23.814
What is the difference between 4 or 5 prior convictions?

614
37:23.884 --> 37:25.444
Reveal it all if you want.

615
37:32.724 --> 37:34.124
Hello.

616
37:37.094 --> 37:40.034
I am here because you are looking for a part-timer.

617
37:40.334 --> 37:42.534
You are the one who called earlier, right?

618
37:42.594 --> 37:44.634
- Yes. - Just a moment.

619
37:49.804 --> 37:51.744
I am Lee Eun Ok.

620
37:52.344 --> 37:55.674
Hello. My name is Han Gyu Rim.

621
37:59.814 --> 38:01.554
I misread the address,

622
38:01.614 --> 38:03.454
so I had a hard time finding this place.

623
38:03.954 --> 38:07.024
Could I possibly get a glass of iced Americano?

624
38:07.954 --> 38:10.864
We do not have a coffee machine at home,

625
38:11.064 --> 38:13.124
so I will go out and buy one right away.

626
38:13.294 --> 38:14.564
An iced Americano?

627
38:15.294 --> 38:17.704
Yes, if possible. Make it decaf.

628
38:18.134 --> 38:20.604
- Okay, please take a rest here. - Okay.

629
38:21.134 --> 38:22.134
Yes.

630
38:27.474 --> 38:30.084
Gyu Min, Gyu Seo, Mom is here.

631
38:31.084 --> 38:32.984
Your sisters and brother did not mistreat you, did they?

632
38:37.484 --> 38:40.394
How does Gyu Rim not notice?

633
38:47.734 --> 38:49.494
Right, she and I...

634
38:49.564 --> 38:51.934
look like completely different people.

635
38:53.364 --> 38:55.174
It makes sense that Gyu Rim cannot recognise me.

636
38:58.704 --> 39:02.714
The plastic surgery in our country really is the best in the world.

637
39:12.624 --> 39:14.424
He attends this art academy,

638
39:15.054 --> 39:16.394
and it is time for him to come down.

639
39:20.964 --> 39:23.294
- Bye. - Goodbye.

640
39:25.564 --> 39:26.834
(Recruiting New Students)

641
39:27.774 --> 39:30.374
Bye, take care. See you tomorrow, Lee Da Som.

642
39:32.274 --> 39:33.514
That child is Han Gyeol.

643
39:41.554 --> 39:42.784
What do you think, Secretary An?

644
39:44.224 --> 39:45.684
Do you think he looks like Mu Jin?

645
39:45.924 --> 39:48.354
If you are asking for my personal opinion,

646
39:49.794 --> 39:50.794
yes, he does.

647
39:53.694 --> 39:54.694
Hey, kid.

648
39:56.064 --> 39:57.064
Hey, kid.

649
40:01.074 --> 40:02.074
Me?

650
40:07.274 --> 40:08.474
Yes, you.

651
40:08.974 --> 40:10.584
I heard there is a great tteokbokki place...

652
40:10.644 --> 40:11.644
in this neighbourhood...

653
40:11.714 --> 40:15.284
- Do you happen to know where it is? - The Tteokbokki Hall of Fame?

654
40:16.654 --> 40:20.024
You mean the place that was on TV, right?

655
40:20.994 --> 40:22.224
Yes, that one.

656
40:23.494 --> 40:26.124
You go straight that way, and when you see the dry cleaner,

657
40:26.194 --> 40:28.164
you just turn and keep going.

658
40:30.564 --> 40:31.564
But...

659
40:32.104 --> 40:34.734
honestly, that place is not that good.

660
40:36.274 --> 40:38.204
Why?

661
40:38.674 --> 40:41.874
It was on TV, but the taste is nothing special.

662
40:42.774 --> 40:45.614
It is just spicy, the line is long for no reason,

663
40:46.114 --> 40:47.784
and the owner is unfriendly.

664
40:48.384 --> 40:49.584
Really?

665
40:50.054 --> 40:51.184
By the way...

666
40:51.484 --> 40:54.154
Are you a wheat cake or rice cake person?

667
40:55.124 --> 40:58.264
Me? Rice cakes?

668
40:59.024 --> 41:01.264
Then if you like rice cakes, there is a place...

669
41:01.464 --> 41:02.564
I would like to recommend.

670
41:03.604 --> 41:07.974
My aunt is a tteokbokki fanatic, and it is her favourite spot.

671
41:08.234 --> 41:11.004
It's called Jjangmat Tteokbokki, and it's really good.

672
41:12.274 --> 41:13.614
If you mention Han Gyu Min's name,

673
41:13.674 --> 41:15.874
they will give you one egg on the house.

674
41:17.144 --> 41:20.514
Okay, then I should go there.

675
41:22.214 --> 41:23.214
But...

676
41:24.054 --> 41:26.024
Who do you take after to be so smart?

677
41:26.354 --> 41:27.394
My mom.

678
41:30.094 --> 41:31.264
You do not take after your dad?

679
41:31.994 --> 41:33.194
My dad...

680
41:34.434 --> 41:35.494
I do not know.

681
41:36.294 --> 41:38.664
I have never seen him.

682
41:41.274 --> 41:42.274
Is that so?

683
41:45.274 --> 41:46.274
Han Gyeol.

684
41:48.814 --> 41:49.874
Mom.

685
41:54.954 --> 41:55.954
Who is that?

686
41:57.454 --> 41:58.924
Just a lady I do not know,

687
41:59.284 --> 42:01.154
she asked for a good tteokbokki place.

688
42:01.894 --> 42:03.494
Did you explain it to her nicely?

689
42:04.124 --> 42:05.294
Of course.

690
42:05.764 --> 42:07.094
Good job.

691
42:07.864 --> 42:09.194
What did you draw at the academy today?

692
42:09.464 --> 42:11.404
- Happiness. - Happiness?

693
42:11.464 --> 42:14.434
The teacher told us to draw happiness.

694
42:14.574 --> 42:17.904
Really? Then how did my Gyeol draw it?

695
42:18.204 --> 42:19.244
I drew myself.

696
42:19.604 --> 42:24.244
- Yourself? Han Gyeol? - Yes, I am happiness, Mom.

697
42:24.614 --> 42:27.584
You said so, that you became happy because of me.

698
42:29.754 --> 42:32.724
Right, my Gyeol is happiness.

699
42:32.954 --> 42:34.694
So you drew happiness as Gyeol?

700
42:35.324 --> 42:37.264
My baby is a real genius.

701
42:40.564 --> 42:43.964
- Happiness is here. - Happiness came to Mom.

702
42:44.034 --> 42:45.034
Han Gyu Rim.

703
42:46.404 --> 42:48.674
You really raised your kid well.

704
42:48.734 --> 42:53.104
- Happiness is here. - Happiness came to Mom.

705
42:55.574 --> 42:56.574
Who?

706
42:57.344 --> 42:58.344
Our Gyeol?

707
42:59.584 --> 43:00.584
Why is Gyeol a burden...

708
43:01.614 --> 43:04.484
A burden, yes, right, a burden.

709
43:05.524 --> 43:08.324
Even when I come back from seeing my Son-in-law Kim...

710
43:08.994 --> 43:10.594
and smile to myself because I am happy,

711
43:10.864 --> 43:11.924
just thinking about Gyeol...

712
43:12.494 --> 43:15.294
makes my chest feel tight and gives me indigestion.

713
43:16.694 --> 43:18.064
Hey, let us hang up.

714
43:19.004 --> 43:22.404
No, the grim reaper in our house is glaring at me right now.

715
43:23.474 --> 43:25.744
No, not Gyu Young, there is someone else.

716
43:26.374 --> 43:28.114
I do not know where he went to recharge his batteries,

717
43:28.714 --> 43:30.044
but he is stronger than Gyu Young.

718
43:31.414 --> 43:33.144
Yes, call me later.

719
43:33.854 --> 43:34.854
Yes.

720
43:36.854 --> 43:37.854
Why is Gyeol a burden?

721
43:39.984 --> 43:40.994
Of course he is a burden.

722
43:41.324 --> 43:42.554
Do you think he is some kind of treasure?

723
43:43.124 --> 43:44.464
Of course Gyeol is a treasure.

724
43:44.694 --> 43:46.164
He is a treasure to my oldest sister,

725
43:46.224 --> 43:47.894
to Gyu Min and me,

726
43:48.294 --> 43:50.034
and to Gyu Oh as well. Gyeol is our treasure.

727
43:50.134 --> 43:52.934
Right, well, to you guys, he might be a treasure,

728
43:53.034 --> 43:55.674
but to me, he is a burden. What are you going to do about it?

729
43:55.974 --> 43:57.274
When my daughter gets married,

730
43:57.404 --> 43:59.644
he will be the biggest burden standing in her way.

731
43:59.944 --> 44:01.774
- What are you going to do about it? - Father.

732
44:01.914 --> 44:04.544
Hey, my neck hurts from looking up at you. Sit down.

733
44:06.814 --> 44:08.084
I said, sit down.

734
44:10.924 --> 44:11.924
Hey.

735
44:16.054 --> 44:18.224
Since we are on the subject,

736
44:18.594 --> 44:20.934
honestly, this is Son-in-law Kim's first marriage,

737
44:21.234 --> 44:22.794
he is the CEO of that huge restaurant,

738
44:22.994 --> 44:26.164
he has a lot of money saved up, and he is a five-star catch.

739
44:26.434 --> 44:27.774
But your sister has nothing to show for herself.

740
44:27.834 --> 44:29.274
She is dirt poor,

741
44:29.474 --> 44:31.904
and she has a bunch of younger siblings to take care of.

742
44:32.204 --> 44:34.974
Fine, let us say all of that is okay.

743
44:35.274 --> 44:38.584
Cinderella lived in an attic and was dirt poor,

744
44:38.744 --> 44:40.244
but she still married a prince.

745
44:40.914 --> 44:43.754
Simcheong had a blind father...

746
44:44.054 --> 44:46.924
and was a beggar without a single grain of rice,

747
44:47.394 --> 44:51.524
but she married a king and became a queen, right?

748
44:52.824 --> 44:53.864
But...

749
44:54.294 --> 44:56.194
But do you know...

750
44:56.264 --> 44:57.764
what Cinderella and Simcheong have in common?

751
44:59.504 --> 45:02.934
All those poor heroines in those countless fairy tales,

752
45:03.234 --> 45:04.774
what they have in common is...

753
45:05.674 --> 45:08.874
they do not have a burden like your sister does.

754
45:11.044 --> 45:15.214
Hey, what parents-in-law would like a single mother with a kid?

755
45:16.084 --> 45:18.054
If your son ever brought home a woman like that...

756
45:18.124 --> 45:19.424
and introduced her as your daughter-in-law,

757
45:19.484 --> 45:21.924
would you tell her she is pretty and great...

758
45:21.994 --> 45:23.654
and welcome her with open arms like this?

759
45:25.064 --> 45:27.634
But Mu Jin adores Gyeol.

760
45:28.664 --> 45:30.034
He loves him like his own son.

761
45:31.034 --> 45:32.034
Is that not enough?

762
45:33.034 --> 45:36.674
Hey, do you think it is enough that just the two of them are happy?

763
45:37.704 --> 45:40.304
Our Gyu Rim...

764
45:41.544 --> 45:43.174
When I think about her being criticized because of Gyeol...

765
45:43.714 --> 45:45.614
and being mistreated by her mother-in-law,

766
45:47.114 --> 45:48.614
I cannot even sleep these days.

767
45:49.254 --> 45:50.524
Do not lie.

768
45:51.054 --> 45:53.124
You were snoring so loudly and sleeping just fine.

769
45:53.894 --> 45:55.554
If my Gyu Rim's husband's family hates Gyeol,

770
45:55.724 --> 45:57.224
I can just raise him myself.

771
45:57.524 --> 45:59.694
How are you going to raise him? Are you not going to get married?

772
45:59.764 --> 46:00.764
I am not getting married.

773
46:01.564 --> 46:02.564
Happy?

774
46:02.934 --> 46:03.934
Goodness.

775
46:07.204 --> 46:09.534
So, I am hired, right?

776
46:10.304 --> 46:11.304
Yes.

777
46:11.974 --> 46:14.974
You can start coming in to work the day before we reopen the store.

778
46:15.414 --> 46:17.044
Thank you.

779
46:17.614 --> 46:19.114
I look forward to working with you.

780
46:19.344 --> 46:20.414
Yes, thank you.

781
46:20.614 --> 46:22.054
I look forward to working with you too.

782
46:23.454 --> 46:25.184
I will get going, then.

783
46:25.324 --> 46:27.294
I will see you the day before we open.

784
46:27.554 --> 46:28.754
Okay. Get home safely.

785
46:28.824 --> 46:30.494
Yes, I will just throw this away on my way out.

786
46:30.564 --> 46:31.564
Okay.

787
46:33.934 --> 46:34.934
Bye.

788
46:42.704 --> 46:43.804
Yes, sweetie.

789
46:46.344 --> 46:47.874
Am I a burden to you, Mom?

790
46:49.014 --> 46:52.484
What do you mean? Who said something like that to you?

791
46:54.084 --> 46:55.984
Am I getting in the way...

792
46:57.214 --> 46:58.724
of you getting married?

793
47:01.194 --> 47:03.094
That's not true, Gyeol.

794
47:04.524 --> 47:07.764
I told you what you mean to me.

795
47:08.394 --> 47:09.994
Did you forget what I told you?

796
47:10.934 --> 47:12.404
I didn't forget.

797
47:13.634 --> 47:15.034
That when you were in the dark,

798
47:15.174 --> 47:17.474
I came and turned on the light for you.

799
47:18.544 --> 47:20.874
That I'm the reason you lived.

800
47:22.074 --> 47:23.914
I didn't forget any of it.

801
47:26.484 --> 47:28.454
From now on, don't listen to anyone else...

802
47:28.954 --> 47:30.254
and only listen to me.

803
47:31.054 --> 47:32.154
If I say so,

804
47:32.224 --> 47:34.054
what does it matter what other people say?

805
47:35.194 --> 47:36.494
Don't break up with Mu Jin...

806
47:37.794 --> 47:40.424
because of me, Mom.

807
47:42.264 --> 47:44.634
Don't do that because of me, Mom.

808
47:45.664 --> 47:47.604
Please don't do that, Mom.

809
47:49.134 --> 47:50.134
Okay.

810
47:50.674 --> 47:54.044
I won't break up with him. I will never break up with him.

811
48:01.884 --> 48:03.654
I'm sorry for being a coward.

812
48:05.124 --> 48:06.124
I'm sorry...

813
48:06.984 --> 48:08.954
that I always run away.

814
48:10.194 --> 48:12.064
That won't happen anymore,

815
48:12.924 --> 48:14.594
and I will never do that again,

816
48:15.134 --> 48:17.864
so please don't cry, my baby.

817
48:22.574 --> 48:25.474
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

818
48:31.084 --> 48:32.344
Welcome.

819
48:37.114 --> 48:38.454
What is it now?

820
48:45.494 --> 48:48.364
Why does Sung Wook keep calling me...

821
48:48.434 --> 48:49.594
to ask where you are?

822
48:57.944 --> 48:59.204
Why didn't you try harder to stop me?

823
49:00.004 --> 49:01.014
Stop you from what?

824
49:02.144 --> 49:04.044
When I said I was marrying Kang Sung Wook,

825
49:04.784 --> 49:06.014
why didn't you try harder to stop me?

826
49:09.054 --> 49:12.454
- I tried hard enough. - You should have tried harder.

827
49:12.854 --> 49:15.154
You should have been more persistent and stubborn about it.

828
49:15.924 --> 49:20.594
I paid for the settlement money and tried as stubbornly as I could.

829
49:20.664 --> 49:22.694
You still should have tried harder.

830
49:22.794 --> 49:23.994
Even if you had to pull all my hair out...

831
49:24.064 --> 49:25.604
or break my legs,

832
49:25.864 --> 49:27.264
you should have stopped me no matter what.

833
49:27.474 --> 49:28.474
Right.

834
49:29.274 --> 49:31.944
It's my fault. I'm sorry.

835
49:32.304 --> 49:33.874
I did something unforgivable.

836
49:34.814 --> 49:35.814
Darn it.

837
49:37.044 --> 49:38.384
It's all Han Seok Joong's fault.

838
49:38.684 --> 49:40.644
It's Han Gyu Rim's fault. It's Han Gyu Oh's fault.

839
49:41.354 --> 49:43.684
We're supposed to be family,

840
49:44.054 --> 49:45.624
so why didn't they try harder to stop me?

841
49:46.454 --> 49:48.394
They should have beaten me to stop me.

842
49:48.754 --> 49:50.964
They should have locked me in my room to stop me.

843
49:52.494 --> 49:54.434
My life being ruined like this...

844
49:54.664 --> 49:56.564
is all your fault, Han Seok Joong's fault,

845
49:56.634 --> 49:58.304
Han Gyu Rim's fault, and Han Gyu Oh's fault.

846
50:01.504 --> 50:03.704
Does blaming others make you feel better?

847
50:07.374 --> 50:08.744
What did I do wrong?

848
50:09.874 --> 50:10.884
Liking money?

849
50:11.844 --> 50:13.344
Wanting to climb higher?

850
50:13.984 --> 50:17.724
Go ask anyone on the street if there is anyone who hates money...

851
50:17.724 --> 50:19.724
and has no desire to climb higher.

852
50:20.484 --> 50:21.754
Go ask anyone.

853
50:22.724 --> 50:24.224
Your goal was fine,

854
50:24.764 --> 50:26.024
but your methods were wrong.

855
50:26.664 --> 50:27.794
Just because you like money...

856
50:28.464 --> 50:30.294
and want to climb higher,

857
50:30.664 --> 50:32.204
doesn't mean everyone lives like you.

858
50:35.234 --> 50:36.234
Listen,

859
50:38.144 --> 50:39.244
have you ever been broke?

860
50:41.044 --> 50:43.374
Going from a rich princess to a beggar overnight,

861
50:44.914 --> 50:46.214
being rejected by the person you like,

862
50:46.284 --> 50:47.854
being ignored,

863
50:48.414 --> 50:49.554
having ties cut,

864
50:51.854 --> 50:53.624
and being handed money for tuition and lunch...

865
50:54.154 --> 50:55.554
like a beggar getting a handout.

866
50:55.624 --> 50:56.694
Have you ever experienced that?

867
50:58.924 --> 51:00.424
Because I had no money,

868
51:01.594 --> 51:03.364
my father, who fell off a cliff,

869
51:03.794 --> 51:06.134
couldn't even get proper surgery and passed away.

870
51:08.074 --> 51:09.834
But I still didn't live like you.

871
51:12.604 --> 51:16.374
Fine. You're so high and mighty. That's why you still...

872
51:16.444 --> 51:18.244
live in such a pathetic state.

873
51:19.044 --> 51:20.044
Darn it.

874
51:26.954 --> 51:28.224
Hey, Gyu Young.

875
51:28.794 --> 51:31.294
What's wrong with you? Are you okay?

876
51:37.064 --> 51:39.604
What brings you all the way here, ma'am?

877
51:39.764 --> 51:42.334
What do you mean? Am I not allowed to come to a place like this?

878
51:42.674 --> 51:47.674
That's not what I meant. I am just so grateful and glad...

879
51:47.744 --> 51:51.984
- that you came all the way here. - You are so tall,

880
51:52.044 --> 51:53.044
my neck is killing me.

881
51:53.114 --> 51:56.054
I apologize for being so rudely tall.

882
51:56.554 --> 51:58.254
Well then, today,

883
51:58.524 --> 52:01.954
I will give you some special service,

884
52:02.224 --> 52:04.324
so please take your time and enjoy your meal.

885
52:04.724 --> 52:06.064
Of course.

886
52:06.564 --> 52:09.964
The people in our neighbourhood are the most generous.

887
52:11.064 --> 52:12.234
That is right.

888
52:22.344 --> 52:24.514
I'll get going now,

889
52:24.714 --> 52:26.814
so take your time looking at the menu...

890
52:26.944 --> 52:28.914
and call me when you are ready to order.

891
52:29.714 --> 52:31.654
Alright. Thank you.

892
52:41.434 --> 52:43.764
Even the water tastes good.

893
52:45.134 --> 52:46.304
What would you like to eat, ma'am?

894
52:46.364 --> 52:50.204
- I'll treat you today. - What? I already paid in advance.

895
52:50.304 --> 52:51.304
In advance?

896
52:52.374 --> 52:55.644
Hey. Now, what looks good?

897
52:55.714 --> 52:57.044
Gambas...

898
52:57.474 --> 52:59.114
What is this? It's all in foreign letters.

899
52:59.184 --> 53:01.684
What should I do?

900
53:01.814 --> 53:04.424
I put the pressure cooker in the ginseng chicken soup...

901
53:04.684 --> 53:07.654
No, I put the ginseng chicken soup in the pressure cooker...

902
53:07.724 --> 53:09.094
and completely forgot about it.

903
53:09.154 --> 53:12.464
- What should I do? - Wait, you came out to eat,

904
53:12.624 --> 53:14.664
- but you left soup on the stove? - Yes, yes.

905
53:14.734 --> 53:15.894
Is Heung Sik not home?

906
53:15.994 --> 53:18.864
No. Oh, my house is going to burn down.

907
53:19.004 --> 53:21.504
I will be right back, so order whatever you want. No, no.

908
53:21.574 --> 53:23.534
Order the most delicious thing on the menu, okay?

909
53:23.604 --> 53:25.074
- Oh, dear. - Grandma.

910
53:25.144 --> 53:27.144
Oh, dear.

911
53:47.464 --> 53:48.634
Why is she taking so long?

912
54:22.734 --> 54:23.734
Hello.

913
54:24.764 --> 54:25.764
You are Han Gyu Oh, right?

914
54:28.274 --> 54:32.074
I was introduced by Park Su Nam. My name is Kwon Hee Na.

915
54:35.444 --> 54:37.144
Why are you looking at me so confused?

916
54:40.014 --> 54:41.854
You did not know you were coming to a blind date.

917
54:46.784 --> 54:48.754
I fell in love at first sight.

918
54:50.654 --> 54:51.864
Can I ask you out...

919
54:52.564 --> 54:53.964
on a second date before we even start?

920
55:19.984 --> 55:20.984
Hello.

921
55:44.644 --> 55:45.644
Hello.

922
55:46.684 --> 55:48.314
You are Mu Jin's mother, right?

923
55:50.914 --> 55:51.924
Han Gyu Rim?

924
55:54.054 --> 55:57.024
Yes. My name is Han Gyu Rim.

925
56:14.574 --> 56:16.014
Why are you not saying anything?

926
56:18.584 --> 56:19.814
What is your reason...

927
56:20.944 --> 56:22.584
for coming all the way here to see me?

928
56:27.454 --> 56:28.524
Did you not come here...

929
56:28.524 --> 56:30.194
because you had something to say to me?

930
57:00.724 --> 57:01.994
Are we going to stay up all night?

931
57:10.294 --> 57:12.904
I came to take back what I said.

932
57:16.534 --> 57:18.274
I cannot leave Mu Jin.

933
57:19.804 --> 57:20.974
I need to be...

934
57:21.914 --> 57:23.374
by his side.

935
57:25.584 --> 57:27.084
I tried my best to run away,

936
57:27.744 --> 57:29.354
but I have nowhere left to run,

937
57:31.924 --> 57:33.754
and I no longer want to run away.

938
57:35.554 --> 57:36.594
Look here.

939
57:37.994 --> 57:39.124
Han Gyu Rim.

940
57:41.794 --> 57:43.134
The more you try to stop Mu Jin,

941
57:44.494 --> 57:46.234
the more affectionate he becomes.

942
57:47.034 --> 57:48.874
The more I hide, the more his heart aches.

943
57:49.834 --> 57:51.744
The more I run away, the more desperate he gets.

944
57:53.804 --> 57:55.274
No matter what I do,

945
57:56.274 --> 57:57.614
he never gives up.

946
57:58.214 --> 57:59.514
That is the kind of person he is.

947
58:03.784 --> 58:05.224
If we take this to the very end...

948
58:05.854 --> 58:07.384
and realise it is not meant to be,

949
58:08.294 --> 58:10.554
then I will walk away without any lingering feelings.

950
58:11.924 --> 58:15.464
If we take this to the very end and realise it is truly impossible,

951
58:16.334 --> 58:18.804
then I will walk away without any regrets, resentment,

952
58:18.804 --> 58:19.864
or sorrow.

953
58:21.834 --> 58:23.004
We have to see this through to the end...

954
58:23.074 --> 58:26.644
for Mu Jin to accept it, and only then will he let me go.

955
58:35.384 --> 58:36.384
And...

956
58:40.724 --> 58:41.724
I also...

957
58:43.224 --> 58:44.724
need to see this through to the end.

958
58:45.624 --> 58:49.794
I need to see it through completely so that I can finally let him go.

959
58:51.864 --> 58:52.904
I am sorry.

960
58:54.434 --> 58:56.404
Please take back your threat to cut him off...

961
58:57.504 --> 58:59.474
and please allow us to see each other.

962
59:01.644 --> 59:04.944
Even if we end things, let us end them on our own terms.

963
59:07.984 --> 59:09.054
Please help us.

964
01:00:11.744 --> 01:00:13.684
(Yoon Jin)

965
01:00:20.484 --> 01:00:21.594
Hello?

966
01:00:22.254 --> 01:00:24.824
Han Gyu Rim came to our house to see Mom.

967
01:00:25.564 --> 01:00:26.594
Did you send her?

968
01:00:27.424 --> 01:00:28.464
Gyu Rim did?

969
01:00:29.764 --> 01:00:32.004
She's gotten so brave and bold.

970
01:00:32.764 --> 01:00:34.264
She's not the Han Gyu Rim she used to be.

971
01:00:56.024 --> 01:00:57.054
Mu Jin.

972
01:00:57.354 --> 01:00:59.964
Where are you? Where are you right now?

973
01:01:16.614 --> 01:01:17.914
Is something wrong, my friend?

974
01:01:19.184 --> 01:01:20.484
Why are you drinking alone at this hour?

975
01:01:21.414 --> 01:01:23.254
I just feel like crap.

976
01:01:23.714 --> 01:01:26.954
Why? Did someone say something to you?

977
01:01:28.054 --> 01:01:29.794
Who is it? I'll go teach them a lesson.

978
01:01:34.164 --> 01:01:37.234
I just want to punch that talking mouth of theirs,

979
01:01:37.294 --> 01:01:38.964
but I wonder what good it would do.

980
01:01:39.934 --> 01:01:43.374
I want to slap them in the face, but I wonder what good it would do.

981
01:01:44.874 --> 01:01:48.414
I want to pinch them hard, but I wonder what good it would do.

982
01:01:49.914 --> 01:01:52.184
That's depression accompanied by helplessness.

983
01:01:54.444 --> 01:01:57.814
I am depressed. I'm very depressed.

984
01:01:58.824 --> 01:02:00.024
If you're depressed, that'll be 50 cents.

985
01:02:05.424 --> 01:02:07.124
Put a 50-cent coin in here.

986
01:02:08.334 --> 01:02:10.134
I don't have cash. Do you take cards?

987
01:02:10.394 --> 01:02:11.394
Yes.

988
01:02:24.914 --> 01:02:25.944
Pay in full?

989
01:02:26.784 --> 01:02:27.784
Yes.

990
01:02:37.854 --> 01:02:40.994
Love is leaving

991
01:02:41.364 --> 01:02:44.534
My side once again

992
01:02:44.864 --> 01:02:47.864
It started this time

993
01:02:47.934 --> 01:02:51.404
It was finally love

994
01:02:51.944 --> 01:02:55.114
Did I hope

995
01:02:55.244 --> 01:02:58.784
For too much?

996
01:02:59.314 --> 01:03:04.284
Was I too greedy?

997
01:03:06.184 --> 01:03:07.424
That's 50 cents up to here.

998
01:03:08.694 --> 01:03:09.694
Here.

999
01:03:13.694 --> 01:03:15.294
What on earth are you?

1000
01:03:17.194 --> 01:03:18.734
A swamp you can't escape from.

1001
01:03:19.804 --> 01:03:22.234
Once you fall for me, there's no way out.

1002
01:03:29.714 --> 01:03:30.744
Gyu Rim.

1003
01:03:38.014 --> 01:03:39.024
Are you okay?

1004
01:03:41.894 --> 01:03:42.924
I'm okay.

1005
01:03:44.694 --> 01:03:46.064
Why did you go to my mother?

1006
01:03:48.364 --> 01:03:51.164
I felt like I was being too cowardly,

1007
01:03:52.604 --> 01:03:54.834
hiding behind you and running away.

1008
01:03:56.904 --> 01:03:58.104
What did you tell her?

1009
01:03:59.774 --> 01:04:01.774
I told her I'd go to the end with you...

1010
01:04:02.914 --> 01:04:04.374
and see...

1011
01:04:05.414 --> 01:04:07.014
how things turn out for us.

1012
01:04:10.184 --> 01:04:12.254
Promise me one thing, Mu Jin.

1013
01:04:14.824 --> 01:04:17.094
Let's go to the end and burn it all down.

1014
01:04:18.324 --> 01:04:20.794
Let's burn it all down until there are no ashes left,

1015
01:04:23.964 --> 01:04:26.964
and if it still doesn't work out, let's stop then.

1016
01:04:27.604 --> 01:04:31.404
Without blaming anyone or holding any grudges.

1017
01:05:35.734 --> 01:05:37.704
(Love on the Menu)

1018
01:05:38.074 --> 01:05:39.804
Why are you keeping your mouth shut and not answering?

1019
01:05:39.874 --> 01:05:43.014
You have so many questions, so why don't you ever ask me...

1020
01:05:43.074 --> 01:05:45.044
- what kind of guy I am? - Please hide me.

1021
01:05:45.044 --> 01:05:47.084
- What are you saying right now? - I'll die if I get caught.

1022
01:05:47.144 --> 01:05:48.184
- I'll protect you. - I'm saved.

1023
01:05:48.184 --> 01:05:50.184
If my girl is your daughter-in-law, what are we?

1024
01:05:50.254 --> 01:05:52.154
It's my life to live,

1025
01:05:52.224 --> 01:05:55.594
- so can't you just trust me? - Is Han Gyu Rim that amazing?

1026
01:05:55.654 --> 01:05:57.854
You know his stubbornness can't be broken.

1027
01:05:57.924 --> 01:06:01.664
- He's going to die at this rate. - I love you too, Mu Jin.
